# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Persona routing matrix — mirrors docs/agent-os/personas/README.md
#
# This repo is agent-driven with a single human owner (@nalfeo), so every glob
# below resolves to @nalfeo. The value is the explicit path→persona mapping:
# it documents which persona owns each area and keeps @nalfeo as the required
# reviewer/owner for it. CODEOWNERS is last-match-wins, so these globs are
# ordered general → specific (e.g. src/engine before src/engine/sprites).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Systems Engineer — core ECS: components, systems, queries, determinism
/src/core/** @nalfeo

# UX Designer — HUD, menus, onboarding, controls, interaction polish (engine layer)
/src/engine/** @nalfeo

# Graphics Designer — sprites, tilesets, VFX, palettes, sprite briefs
/src/engine/sprites/** @nalfeo
/briefs/** @nalfeo
/data/palettes/** @nalfeo

# Game Designer — mechanics, economy, progression pacing, tuning, balance labs
/src/game/** @nalfeo
/src/labs/** @nalfeo
/src/shared/data/tuning.json @nalfeo

# Content Designer — authored floor/quest/encounter packs (validated data)
/src/shared/data/quests.*.json @nalfeo

# AI Content Engineer — Ollama integration, prompt + schema flows (floor-load only)
/src/game/ai/** @nalfeo

# QA Engineer — tests, coverage, property/invariant tests, regression, mutation
/tests/** @nalfeo

# Story Designer — lore, flavor text, season framing, The Director's voice
/docs/knowledge/game-design/lore-bible.md @nalfeo

# DevOps Engineer — CI, verify scripts, harness, tooling, gates.
# (CI workflows and scripts/agent are also covered by the critical block above.)
/.github/actions/** @nalfeo

